 "notes": {
  "7302:2689": "he turns and a crowd of penguins is revealed behind him; 'reveal' is arguable for the surprise moment",
  "435:2291": "the customer tries on a leather jacket; putting on different clothing can be read as 'change'",
  "4948:3334": "a whole city district of tower blocks fills the window; 'neighbourhood' could be argued for the view",
  "408:5022": "he pulls a jacket on over his sweater; a learner could read that as changing clothes",
  "629:1788": "the raging storm they flee is frightening and their relief implies they were scared",
  "4018:1770": "the dogs hop down and move about on the track; the scooter also 'runs' along the track",
  "4365:1637": "the rolls come out of the oven on a baking tray, which can be called a (baking) pan",
  "620:2395": "a rose field: the soil/ground the roses grow in is plausibly visible",
  "5451:6066": "clinic with patients waiting and an injection; illness is loosely implied by the setting",
  "123:2395": "berry farm with bushes growing from the ground; soil plausibly visible",
  "45:1955": "she walks in and unexpectedly finds her clothes thrown on the floor; a moment of surprise is implied",
  "6907:3785": "a pile of close friends celebrating together; 'be there for someone' describes buddies in general",
  "4841:1533": "a key is the thing you lock with; strongly associated though no locking is shown"
 }
